{"indicator":"per-capita/oil","unit":"桶/人","years":[1980,1981,1982,1983,1984,1985,1986,1987,1988,1989,1990,1991,1992,1993,1994,1995,1996,1997,1998,1999,2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024],"notes":{"TWN":"EIA 的台灣原油產量 2015 年起每年都是 0.196 千桶/日（沿用舊值）；能源署的自產原油 2024 年約 1.3 千公噸油當量（約 0.03 千桶/日）。台灣的原油幾乎全部進口，消費量含煉油廠用的燃料與石化原料。","SGP":"新加坡是煉油與船舶加油的樞紐，EIA 的石油消費量包含煉油廠自用、石化原料與賣給國際航線的燃料，人均消費量因此很高。","NLD":"荷蘭是煉油與船舶加油的樞紐，EIA 的石油消費量包含煉油廠自用、石化原料與賣給國際航線的燃料，人均消費量因此很高。","_SUN":"已經不存在的國家，畫在當時的首都；人均消費量的人口是今天的繼承國在當年的人口加總（UN WPP 依現在的國界回推）。","_YUG":"已經不存在的國家，畫在當時的首都；人均消費量的人口是今天的繼承國在當年的人口加總（UN WPP 依現在的國界回推）。","_CSK":"已經不存在的國家，畫在當時的首都；人均消費量的人口是今天的繼承國在當年的人口加總（UN WPP 依現在的國界回推）。","_SCG":"已經不存在的國家，畫在當時的首都；人均消費量的人口是今天的繼承國在當年的人口加總（UN WPP 依現在的國界回推）。","DEU":"1990 年以前是西德與東德的合計。","RUS":"1991 年以前見蘇聯（地圖上畫在莫斯科的圓）。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"EIA shows Taiwan's crude oil output at 0.196 thousand b/d every year since 2015 (a carried-over value); the Energy Administration reports about 1.3 thousand toe of domestic crude in 2024 (about 0.03 thousand b/d). Taiwan imports nearly all its crude; consumption includes refinery fuel and petrochemical feedstock.","SGP":"Singapore is a refining and bunkering hub; EIA's oil consumption includes refinery use, petrochemical feedstock and fuel sold to international shipping, so consumption per person is very high.","NLD":"the Netherlands is a refining and bunkering hub; EIA's oil consumption includes refinery use, petrochemical feedstock and fuel sold to international shipping, so consumption per person is very high.","_SUN":"A country that no longer exists, drawn at its former capital; population for per-person figures is the sum of today's successor states in that year (UN WPP back-casts to current borders).","_YUG":"A country that no longer exists, drawn at its former capital; population for per-person figures is the sum of today's successor states in that year (UN WPP back-casts to current bo